        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Immunisation history (partial, AIR and patient recall)"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Childhood schedule complete. Last documented dTpa was more than 10 years ago; patient is unsure of the last tetanus/pertussis booster. COVID Pfizer primary course x2 in 2021 and booster in 2022; no 2023/24 boosters. Influenza vaccine in 2023; none yet in 2025."
      }
    },
